## Task 4 - Let the Machine Do the Searching

### Commands

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `find` | Search files by name |
| `grep` | Search text inside files |

### Lab Commands

```bash
cd /home/tryhackme
grep "THM" access.log
```

### Example

```bash
find -name passwords.txt
grep "password123" passwords.txt
```

### Flag

```
THM{...}
```

